{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾正在籌備兩款面向入門級筆記本電腦的新處理器系列，分別為Moon Lake和Wildcat Lake Refresh。據最新爆料，兩者都將圍繞英特爾18A製程技術展開，其中Moon Lake定位更低，甚至可能完全取消傳統性能核，僅保留低功耗能效核；Wildcat Lake Refresh則會增加性能核數量，並擴大可配置功耗範圍，為預算有限的筆記本電腦提供更強的處理能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584302.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:02:07.889896+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:40:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.325681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.325681+00:00","content_hash":"76a4880a4f1f98aedba8a14cbb7c010b6ae42f616b4cba63debecf37993e25fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}